WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.400
Start with one clear subject. Place your

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:04.700
subject on the left. Use three words

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:06.800
in the headline. Do not use 30

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:10.460
words. Choose a contrasting background. Check the

00:00:10.460 --> 00:00:12.940
thumbnail at small size. Keep the same

00:00:12.940 --> 00:00:15.620
visual language. your finished thumbnail.